{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the first chapter in Reverie: Dreams of Sand, a sci-fi Sokoban-style time-manipulation puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve short but difficult puzzles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/extras/puzzleBunchSHORT.gif?t=1744391352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover who Reverie is by filling out her notebook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/extras/NotebookSHORT.gif?t=1744391352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal surreal landscapes as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/extras/ExplorationSHORT.gif?t=1744391352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through vignettes based on Reverie's psyche. Decide how she remembers her past, and find out what's happening to her when she wakes up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/extras/Tremor.gif?t=1744391352\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645900?t=1744391352","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/1e46f829cd480bd730ac3a3a3d2718cb46dd8a0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744391352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/3536ed169493ebceaa9b7e2425cd217252914077/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744391352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645900/3536ed169493ebceaa9b7e2425cd217252914077/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744391352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller sup